---
import BaseLayout from '../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Breadcrumbs from '../../../components/Breadcrumbs.astro';
import AffiliateDisclosure from '../../../components/AffiliateDisclosure.astro';
import MerchantLink from '../../../components/MerchantLink.astro';
import SourceBlock from '../../../components/SourceBlock.astro';
const title = 'SE Ranking vs Mangools (2026): Frozen 25-Keyword Test';
const description = 'SE Ranking and Mangools compared on the same 25 keywords, six SERPs, rank tracking, domain research, backlinks, limits, and workflow.';
const canonical = '/compare/se-ranking-vs-mangools/';
const schema = {'@context':'https://schema.org','@type':'Article',headline:title,description,datePublished:'2026-09-21',dateModified:'2026-09-21',author:{'@type':'Organization',name:'SelectVerdict'},publisher:{'@type':'Organization',name:'SelectVerdict'}};
const sources = [
 {title:'SE Ranking hands-on results',url:'https://github.com/elgaross-pixel/selectverdict/blob/main/evidence/phase-1a/seranking/2026-09-21/P1A-20260921-SERANKING-RESULTS-001.md',publisher:'SelectVerdict',accessedAt:new Date('2026-09-21'),supports:'SE Ranking frozen-run outputs, workflow, limits, cost, and verification.'},
 {title:'Mangools hands-on results',url:'https://github.com/elgaross-pixel/selectverdict/blob/main/evidence/phase-1a/mangools/2026-09-21/P1A-20260921-MANGOOLS-RESULTS-001.md',publisher:'SelectVerdict',accessedAt:new Date('2026-09-21'),supports:'Mangools frozen-run outputs, Free+ limits, cost, and verification.'},
 {title:'Raw observable comparison',url:'https://github.com/elgaross-pixel/selectverdict/blob/main/evidence/phase-1a/comparison/2026-09-21/P1A-20260921-SERANKING-VS-MANGOOLS-COMPARISON-001.md',publisher:'SelectVerdict',accessedAt:new Date('2026-09-21'),supports:'Keyword rows, SERP overlap, rank availability, domain fields, backlinks, and comparison rules.'}
];
const volumes = [
 ['systeme io','4,400','8,200'],['se ranking review','10','880'],['mangools','440','1,500'],['best rank tracking tools','10','1,000'],['best keyword research tools','30','660']
];
const serps = [
 ['systeme io review','10 rows','17 rows; top 10 used; 9/10 overlap'],
 ['systeme io pricing','10 rows','7 rows; 7/7 overlap'],
 ['clickfunnels alternatives','10 rows','9 rows; 8/9 overlap'],
 ['se ranking vs mangools','10 rows','Unavailable / limit'],
 ['best affordable seo tools','10 rows','Unavailable / limit'],
 ['best rank tracking tools','10 rows','Unavailable / limit']
];
---
<BaseLayout title={title} description={description} canonical={canonical} schema={schema}>
<Breadcrumbs items={[{label:'Home',href:'/'},{label:'Compare',href:'/compare/'},{label:'SE Ranking vs Mangools'}]}/>
<article><header class="section"><div class="container"><p class="eyebrow">Hands-on comparison</p><h1>{title}</h1><p class="lede">One frozen dataset, two non-interchangeable outputs, and no aggregate winner score.</p><p class="meta">Published September 21, 2026 · Evidence verified September 21, 2026</p></div></header>
<div class="narrow prose article-body">
<AffiliateDisclosure hasRelationship={true}/>
<aside class="merchant-links" aria-label="Product destinations"><strong>Product destinations:</strong> <MerchantLink href="https://seranking.com/" merchant="se-ranking" product="se-ranking" sourcePage={canonical} affiliate={false} label="Visit SE Ranking (non-affiliate)" /> · <MerchantLink href="https://mangools.com#a6aaf5d686aee08e4110a3d0e" merchant="mangools" product="mangools" sourcePage={canonical} affiliate={true} label="Visit Mangools (affiliate)" /></aside>
<h2>Short answer</h2>
<p>SE Ranking completed all six fixed SERP deep-dives and returned 24 of 25 rank rows. Mangools Free+ produced one full and two partial SERP exports before the observed allowance was exhausted, and no ranks returned during the verification window. Mangools still completed the full keyword import plus SiteProfiler and LinkMiner checks for every frozen domain.</p>
<p>This is a dated run result, not a universal product ranking. Plan limits, access path, database coverage, and result timing all affected the outcome.</p>
<h2>How we tested</h2>
<p>We froze 25 keywords, six SERP queries, selectverdict.com as the tracked domain, and semrush.com, ahrefs.com, and moz.com as reference domains. The target was Google, United States, Desktop, with English where the product exposed the setting. We did not replace missing inputs, average disagreements, or convert proprietary metrics.</p>
<h2>Keyword volume disagreement</h2>
<table><thead><tr><th>Keyword</th><th>SE Ranking</th><th>Mangools</th></tr></thead><tbody>{volumes.map(row=><tr>{row.map(cell=><td>{cell}</td>)}</tr>)}</tbody></table>
<p>Volume differed on most rows. SE Ranking returned explicit no-data for “systeme io free plan” and “mangools vs se ranking”; Mangools returned 110 and 10. This is data disagreement, not feature absence. KD and paid-competition metrics remain under their original product labels.</p>
<h2>SERP coverage</h2>
<table><thead><tr><th>Query</th><th>SE Ranking</th><th>Mangools</th></tr></thead><tbody>{serps.map(row=><tr>{row.map(cell=><td>{cell}</td>)}</tr>)}</tbody></table>
<p>The live runs occurred on the same date but not at the same instant, so order differences can include SERP change.</p>
<h2>Rank tracking</h2>
<p>Both products configured all 25 keywords. SE Ranking returned 24 rows; one remained unavailable. Mangools returned no positions during the final poll. This is an observed data-availability difference, not evidence that Mangools lacks rank tracking.</p>
<h2>Domain and backlink evidence</h2>
<p>SE Ranking exposed estimated organic keyword and traffic fields for the reference domains. The captured Mangools overview exposed authority and link-popularity fields instead. Field absence is not zero.</p>
<p>For selectverdict.com, SE Ranking showed zero backlinks and zero referring domains; Mangools showed three active backlinks and three referring domains. We preserve the database disagreement and do not average it. InLink Rank is not equated to DA, PA, CF, TF, or WPR.</p>
<h2>Workflow and cost</h2>
<p>SE Ranking ran through official APIs after the browser route hit human verification. The successful runtime was 524.734 seconds and the recorded balance delta was 1020 API units. Mangools ran in its authenticated UI, where SERP result expansion consumed the observed allowance and ranks were delayed. Direct monetary cost was $0 for each run; complete human labor was not reliably instrumented.</p>
<h2>Verdict</h2>
<p>Choose by the module, plan, and timing requirement—not a blended score. In this test, SE Ranking produced more complete immediate SERP and rank evidence. Mangools Free+ delivered the full keyword batch and four-domain research with convenient exports, but its observed limits constrained a one-session benchmark.</p>
<p>Read the <a href="/reviews/se-ranking/">SE Ranking review</a>, the <a href="/reviews/mangools/">Mangools review</a>, or the <a href="/guides/seo-tools-benchmark-1/">complete Benchmark #1 methodology</a>.</p>
<SourceBlock sources={sources}/>
</div></article></BaseLayout>
<style>.article-body{padding-block:3rem 5rem}.article-body>:global(*)+:global(*){margin-top:1rem}.article-body>:global(.disclosure){margin-bottom:2rem}.merchant-links{padding:1rem 1.25rem;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:.75rem;background:var(--surface-muted)}table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;display:block;overflow-x:auto}th,td{padding:.7rem;border:1px solid var(--line);text-align:left;white-space:nowrap}</style>
